CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Temp/dev files
__pycache__/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.pyc
node_modules/

# Teacher reference materials
Spec and Materials/

# Exam board specifications (copyrighted — kept locally for pipeline use only).
# Exception: the index.json metadata (board/subject/code/slug only — factual, not
# copyrightable) ships so /admin/build-status can render the To-Build catalogue.
# Note: must use `specs/*` rather than `specs/` so Git still recurses into the
# directory and honours the !specs/index.json negation.
specs/*
!specs/index.json

# Subject-build scaffolding (agent inputs / scratch — never needs to ship)
# - _spec_*.txt files: derivative excerpts from copyrighted exam-board specs
# - _source/: dumps of existing Supabase content fetched as agent reference
scripts/_content_*/_spec_*.txt
scripts/_content_*/_source/

# NotebookLM batch pipeline scratch (transient state, temp files, daily logs)
scripts/_batch_explainer_state.json
scripts/_batch_podcast_state.json
scripts/_explainer_videos/
scripts/_explainer_daily_logs/
scripts/_temp_*

